('link','Faculties & programmes','programmes','Browse the university’s academic programme directory.','','','published',8,'{"url":"https://madukauniversity.edu.ng/programmes","category":"School information","placement":"directory","instructions":"Use this official listing for programme information. Confirm course-specific questions with your department."}'::jsonb),
('link','Official school news','news','Read announcements published on the university website.','','','published',9,'{"url":"https://madukauniversity.edu.ng/news","category":"School information","placement":"directory","instructions":"Open a story to read the full announcement and check its date."}'::jsonb),
('link','Campus life','campus','Explore the school’s campus-life information.','','','published',10,'{"url":"https://madukauniversity.edu.ng/campus-life","category":"School information","placement":"directory","instructions":"For accommodation allocation or individual support, contact the school directly."}'::jsonb),
('link','Contact the university','contact','Find the university’s published contact details.','','','published',11,'{"url":"https://madukauniversity.edu.ng/contact","category":"Help & contacts","placement":"directory","instructions":"Use the contact page for current phone numbers, email and location information."}'::jsonb),
('guide','Before you arrive','before-you-arrive','Check the school’s full prospectus before packing. It covers registration documents, what to bring and what is not allowed.','','','published',0,'{"link_url":"https://madukauniversity.edu.ng/prospectus","link_label":"Read the official prospectus"}'::jsonb),
('guide','Registration documents','registration-documents','The prospectus lists admission and examination records, identity documents, references and payment evidence. Check its exact originals-and-copies requirements.','','','published',1,'{"link_url":"https://madukauniversity.edu.ng/prospectus","link_label":"Check the document requirements"}'::jsonb),
('guide','School forms','school-forms','Clearance, hostel bio-data, undertaking and registration forms are available through the prospectus downloads. Choose the current session’s version.','','','published',2,'{"link_url":"https://madukauniversity.edu.ng/prospectus","link_label":"Find the official forms"}'::jsonb),
('guide','Packing & hostel rules','packing-hostel-rules','Recommended items include bedding, toiletries, a rechargeable lamp, buckets and suitable clothing. Read the prohibited-items list before bringing appliances or other equipment.','','','published',3,'{"link_url":"https://madukauniversity.edu.ng/prospectus","link_label":"Check what you can bring"}'::jsonb),
('guide','Student portal & results','student-portal-results','The student portal accepts an email, registration or matriculation number. Keep your school login details private. The separate results service is linked on our school-links page.','','','published',4,'{"link_url":"https://portal.madukauniversity.edu.ng/login","link_label":"Open the student portal"}'::jsonb),
('guide','Fees & payments','fees-payments','Check the school’s current fee announcement and your official invoice. Follow verified university payment instructions for your session.','','','published',5,'{"link_url":"https://madukauniversity.edu.ng/","link_label":"Find official fee information"}'::jsonb),
('guide','Learning resources','learning-resources','The university website links to its e-learning platform and library. Our Academic Archive is a separate place for student study materials.','','','published',6,'{"link_url":"https://elearn.madukauniversity.edu.ng/","link_label":"Open e-learning"}'::jsonb),
('guide','Getting help','getting-help','For university enquiries, use the official contact page. For help from your student representatives, choose Ask us to reach SCF.','','','published',7,'{"link_url":"https://madukauniversity.edu.ng/contact","link_label":"Get official contact details"}'::jsonb),
